WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.464
Stage 4 is bookings and calendar sync.

00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:21.183
Set your weekly opening hours and appointment length, then connect Google Calendar or Microsoft 365.

00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:29.857
Concierge checks your real availability, reads the exact time back before locking it in, and sends a confirmation with a link to reschedule or cancel, plus reminders 24 hours and 2 hours before.

00:00:29.857 --> 00:00:26.350
Click, preview the next 7 days, to check your available slots straight away.
